@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……记得你叫夏目安安，对吗。|#0101Adv09_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0101Adv09_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安并没有开口回应。<br>她的嘴唇紧闭，只用一只眼睛紧盯着艾玛。|#0101Adv09_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（她是不是有话要跟我说……？）|#0101Adv09_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安的神情有些焦急，<br>一直望着艾玛。|#0101Adv09_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，你找我有什么事？|#0101Adv09_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0101Adv09_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（她是不是很怕生啊……）|#0101Adv09_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安深深叹了一口气，<br>准备打开手上拿着的素描本。<br>可是——|#0101Adv09_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

